#{4}":[266,268],"##Troubleshooting MID server SSL issues#Example Troubleshooting#OCSP Error#{5}":[269,269],"##Troubleshooting MID server SSL issues#Example Troubleshooting#OCSP Error#{6}":[270,271],"##Troubleshooting MID server SSL issues#Example Troubleshooting#OCSP Error#{7}":[272,277]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Security Checks","target":"#security_checks \"Security Checks\"","line":29},{"title":"Bootstrap Parameters","target":"#bootstrap_parameters \"Bootstrap Parameters\"","line":30},{"title":"Common Errors","target":"#common_errors \"Common Errors\"","line":31},{"title":"Troubleshooting","target":"#troubleshooting \"Troubleshooting\"","line":32},{"title":"Set ssl debug","target":"#set_ssl_debug \"Set ssl debug\"","line":33},{"title":"Example troubleshooting","target":"#example_troubleshooting \"Example troubleshooting\"","line":34},{"title":"Certificate Chain Error","target":"#certificate_chain_error \"Certificate Chain Error\"","line":35},{"title":"OCSP Error","target":"#ocsp_error \"OCSP Error\"","line":36},{"title":"MID Server certificate check policies","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/search?q=MID+Server+certificate+check+policies \"MID Server certificate check policies\"","line":51},{"title":"MID Servers and Certificates","target":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0863673 \"MID Servers and Certificates\"","line":55},{"title":"MID Server TLS/SSL certificate check policy Quebec upgrade information","target":"KB0867397 \"MID Server TLS/SSL certificate check policy Quebec upgrade information\"","line":56},{"title":"MID server OCSP requirement details","target":"https://hi.service-now.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0854165 \"MID server OCSP requirement details\"","line":57},{"title":"MID Server shows certificate chain errors with self-signed cert","target":"https://hi.service-now.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0864241 \"MID Server shows certificate chain errors with self-signed cert\"","line":58},{"title":"\n    \n4.  Error\n    \n    2021/08/23 06:52:41 | javax.net.ssl|ERROR|52|StartupSequencer|2021-08-23 06:52:41.890 PDT|TransportContext.java:318|Fatal (CERTIFICATE\\_UNKNOWN): PKIX path building failed: java.security.cert.CertPathBuilderException: No issuer certificate for certificate in certification path found. (  \n    2021/08/23 06:52:41 | \"throwable\" : {  \n    2021/08/23 06:52:41 |   sun.security.validator.ValidatorException: PKIX path building failed: java.security.cert.CertPathBuilderException: No issuer certificate for certificate in certification path found.  \n    2021/08/23 06:52:41 |    at java.base/sun.security.validator.PKIXValidator.doBuild(PKIXValidator.java:439)\n    \n\nAbove steps are standard for a SSL handshake. However, the Certificate Chain step fails and the connection is not established. In the Certificate Chain step we can see the certificates sent back to the MID server before the error:\n\n![","target":"sys_attachment.do?sys_id=2ba504a087aaae9457288519dabb3584","line":172},{"title":"MID Server certificate check policies","target":"https://docs.servicenow.com/search?q=MID+Server+certificate+check+policies \"MID Server certificate check policies\"","line":214},{"title":"KB0816002 How to obtain SSL certificate from the browser","target":"https://hi.service-now.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0816002 \"KB0816002 How to obtain SSL certificate from the browser\"","line":223}],"metadata":{"title":"Troubleshooting MID server SSL issues","aliases":["KB0744261"],"tags":["#servicenow","#support-kb"],"source_url":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0744261","kb_number":"KB0744261","last_modified":"2025-07-01"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/it-operations-management/KB0744261 - Troubleshooting MID server SSL issues.md"},
